{"seq":3,"slug":"return-metrics","title":"房地产投资回报指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/foundations/return-metrics","wordCount":1374,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"房地产投资回报指标体系\">房地产投资回报指标体系</h1><p>一位投资者说「这个物业回报率是 8%」，另一位说「才 5%」——他们可能在讨论同一个物业，只是用了不同的指标。房地产投资领域存在一套<strong>层次分明但容易混淆</strong>的回报指标体系，每个指标回答不同的问题。精确使用这些指标是与同行、银行和合作伙伴有效沟通的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-指标层次与适用场景\">核心概念：指标层次与适用场景</h2><p>房地产回报指标可按「是否考虑杠杆」和「是否考虑时间价值」两个维度分为四个象限：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[回报指标体系] --&gt; B[物业层面/无杠杆]&#10;    A --&gt; C[权益层面/含杠杆]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Cap Rate 资本化率&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;NOI Yield 净运营收益率&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;Unlevered IRR&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;Cash-on-Cash 现金回报率&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Equity Multiple 权益倍数&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;Levered IRR&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[时间加权]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;IRR 内部收益率&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;XIRR 不规则现金流IRR&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[风险调整]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;Sharpe Ratio&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;Spread over Risk-Free&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[回报指标体系] --&gt; B[物业层面/无杠杆]\n    A --&gt; C[权益层面/含杠杆]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Cap Rate 资本化率\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"NOI Yield 净运营收益率\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"Unlevered IRR\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"Cash-on-Cash 现金回报率\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Equity Multiple 权益倍数\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"Levered IRR\"]\n    A --&gt; D[时间加权]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"IRR 内部收益率\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"XIRR 不规则现金流IRR\"]\n    A --&gt; E[风险调整]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"Sharpe Ratio\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"Spread over Risk-Free\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>局限性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cap Rate</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NOI / Price</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>物业的即时收益率是多少？</td>\n<td>忽略融资、增值、税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cash-on-Cash</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CashFlow_{after\\ debt} / Equity</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>我的自有资金每年赚多少现金？</td>\n<td>忽略增值和退出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Equity Multiple</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Total\\ Distributions / Equity</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>持有期内本金翻了几倍？</td>\n<td>忽略时间维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IRR</td>\n<td>使 NPV = 0 的折现率</td>\n<td>考虑时间价值后的真实年化回报？</td>\n<td>假设再投资利率 = IRR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOI</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Revenue - OpEx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">pE</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>物业经营效率如何？</td>\n<td>不含资本支出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"资本化率-cap-rate-深度解析\">资本化率（Cap Rate）深度解析</h2><p>Cap Rate 是房地产投资中使用频率最高的单一指标，但也是最容易被误用的。其本质是对<strong>无杠杆、全现金收购</strong>情况下物业即时收益率的度量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>E</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cap\\ Rate = \\frac{NOI}{Purchase\\ Price} = \\frac{Revenue - Operating\\ Expenses}{Purchase\\ Price}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ses</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键注意事项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>NOI 的口径问题</strong>：trailing（过去 12 个月实际）vs. forward（未来 12 个月预测）vs. stabilized（稳定运营假设）差异可达 50-100bp</li>\n<li><strong>Cap Rate 与利率的关系</strong>：理论上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cap\\ Rate \\approx Risk\\text{-}Free\\ Rate + Risk\\ Premium - Growth</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ee</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，2026 年美国 10 年期国债约 4.3%，优质物业 Cap Rate 约 4.5-5.5%，隐含的风险溢价约 150-200bp</li>\n<li><strong>Cap Rate 压缩/扩张</strong>：2022-2024 年加息周期导致全球 Cap Rate 扩张 100-200bp；2025 年起开始选择性压缩</li>\n</ol>\n<p>2026 年主要市场 Cap Rate 参考区间：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物业类型/市场</th>\n<th>美国</th>\n<th>中国一线</th>\n<th>欧洲核心</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>甲级办公</td>\n<td>5.0-6.0%</td>\n<td>4.0-5.0%</td>\n<td>4.5-5.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物流仓储</td>\n<td>4.5-5.5%</td>\n<td>4.5-5.5%</td>\n<td>4.0-5.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多户公寓</td>\n<td>4.5-5.5%</td>\n<td>3.5-4.5%</td>\n<td>3.5-4.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零售商业</td>\n<td>5.5-7.0%</td>\n<td>5.0-6.5%</td>\n<td>5.0-6.5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"现金回报率-cash-on-cash-return\">现金回报率（Cash-on-Cash Return）</h2><p>Cash-on-Cash 回答的是「我实际投入的每一元自有资金，每年能拿到多少现金分配」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>S</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CoC = \\frac{Annual\\ Cash\\ Flow\\ After\\ Debt\\ Service}{Total\\ Equity\\ Invested}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与 Cap Rate 的关键区别在于<strong>引入了杠杆效应</strong>。在正杠杆环境下（物业回报 &gt; 借贷成本），CoC 会高于 Cap Rate：</p>\n<p>假设物业价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext>万，</mtext><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000 万，NOI</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万，</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>60 万（Cap Rate 6%），LTV 70%、利率 5%：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>年债务服务：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>700</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mtext>万</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">700万 \\times 5\\% = 35万</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">700</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span></span></span></span>（仅利息简化）</li>\n<li>权益现金流：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>35</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>万</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60万 - 35万 = 25万</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>CoC：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>300</mn><mtext>万</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>8.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25万 / 300万 = 8.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mord\">/300</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.3%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"内部收益率-irr\">内部收益率（IRR）</h2><p>IRR 是唯一同时考虑<strong>现金流时间分布和退出增值</strong>的全周期指标。它是使得所有现金流入/流出的净现值为零的折现率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 = -Equity_0 + \\sum_{t=1}^{T} \\frac{CF_t}{(1+IRR)^t} + \\frac{Sale\\ Proceeds - Debt\\ Balance}{(1+IRR)^T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7673em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ocee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>IRR 的优势在于奖励早回收——同样 2 倍回报，3 年实现的 IRR（约 26%）远高于 7 年实现的 IRR（约 10.4%）。这也是开发商和增值型投资者偏好短持有期策略的数学原因。</p>\n<p><strong>IRR 的陷阱</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>假设中间现金流能以 IRR 同等利率再投资（MIRR 可修正）</li>\n<li>对小额初始投资敏感，可能产生误导性高 IRR</li>\n<li>无法直接比较规模差异大的项目（需配合 Equity Multiple）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"权益倍数-equity-multiple\">权益倍数（Equity Multiple）</h2><p>权益倍数弥补了 IRR 的规模盲区：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>E</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EM = \\frac{Total\\ Distributions + Residual\\ Value}{Total\\ Equity\\ Invested}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>投资者通常同时看 IRR 和 EM：高 IRR + 低 EM（如 40% IRR 但 1.3x EM）意味着赚钱快但绝对金额有限；低 IRR + 高 EM（如 12% IRR 但 2.5x EM）意味着稳健长持有的大额回报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险调整指标\">风险调整指标</h2><p>原始回报不反映风险。房地产投资中常用的风险调整方式包括：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Spread over Risk-Free</strong>：Cap Rate 或 IRR 相对无风险利率的利差</li>\n<li><strong>风险调整折现率</strong>：对不同策略使用不同 WACC（核心型 7-8%，增值型 10-12%，机会型 15%+）</li>\n<li><strong>下行保护指标</strong>：Break-even Occupancy（保本入住率）= 固定成本 / 每单元最大租金，低于市场空置率即有安全边际</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"指标组合使用实例\">指标组合使用实例</h2><p>一个完整的投资决策不依赖单一指标，而是组合使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>筛选阶段</strong>：Cap Rate 快速过滤（低于目标下限的不看）</li>\n<li><strong>初步分析</strong>：CoC 确认现金流可行性、EM 确认绝对回报目标</li>\n<li><strong>深度建模</strong>：IRR 做全周期 DCF，敏感性分析关键假设</li>\n<li><strong>决策比较</strong>：IRR + EM 双维排序，结合下行场景的 Break-even 分析</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Cap Rate 是最快的市场温度计但不是投资决策指标——它忽略杠杆、增值和退出</li>\n<li>IRR 是全周期最完整的指标但要警惕其「偏爱快钱」和再投资假设</li>\n<li>优秀投资者同时看 IRR 和 Equity Multiple，并用下行场景做压力测试</li>\n<li>所有指标都是模型输出，垃圾进垃圾出——假设的质量决定指标的价值</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"property-types\">物业类型与收益风险图谱</a>——不同物业类型决定了各回报指标的典型区间</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../investment-fundamentals/investment-basics/time-value-of-money\">货币时间价值</a>——IRR 和 DCF 的数学基础在于折现概念</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"房地产投资回报指标体系","id":"房地产投资回报指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：指标层次与适用场景","id":"核心概念-指标层次与适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"资本化率（Cap Rate）深度解析","id":"资本化率-cap-rate-深度解析"},{"level":2,"text":"现金回报率（Cash-on-Cash Return）","id":"现金回报率-cash-on-cash-return"},{"level":2,"text":"内部收益率（IRR）","id":"内部收益率-irr"},{"level":2,"text":"权益倍数（Equity Multiple）","id":"权益倍数-equity-multiple"},{"level":2,"text":"风险调整指标","id":"风险调整指标"},{"level":2,"text":"指标组合使用实例","id":"指标组合使用实例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"物业类型与收益风险图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/foundations/property-types"},"next":{"title":"房地产估值三大方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/real-estate-investing/analysis/valuation-methods"}}